  "body": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\" />\n<title>Papers · Canopticon</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Long original papers by Chris Telford: seven read McLuhan&#39;s claim that media change the ratio among the senses literally, against modern neuroscience.\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://canopticon.com/papers\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Canopticon\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Papers\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Long original papers by Chris Telford: seven read McLuhan&#39;s claim that media change the ratio among the senses literally, against modern neuroscience.\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://canopticon.com/papers\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://canopticon.com/card/index.png\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"Papers\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@canoptics\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Papers\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Long original papers by Chris Telford: seven read McLuhan&#39;s claim that media change the ratio among the senses literally, against modern neuroscience.\" />\n<link rel=\"alternate\" type=\"application/rss+xml\" title=\"Canopticon\" href=\"/feed.xml\" />\n<link rel=\"alternate\" type=\"application/feed+json\" title=\"Canopticon (JSON Feed)\" href=\"/feed.json\" />\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\" />\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&amp;display=swap\" />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/site.css?v=fnsmi5\" />\n<link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"/favicon.svg\" />\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"CollectionPage\",\"@id\":\"https://canopticon.com/papers\",\"url\":\"https://canopticon.com/papers\",\"name\":\"Papers\",\"description\":\"Long original papers by Chris Telford: a seven-paper series reading McLuhan's sense ratios literally, and the papers that build on it.\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"@id\":\"https://canopticon.com/about#chris\",\"name\":\"Chris Telford\",\"url\":\"https://canopticon.com/about\"},\"hasPart\":[{\"@type\":\"ScholarlyArticle\",\"headline\":\"Krasis\",\"url\":\"https://canopticon.com/papers/krasis\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-10-05\",\"author\":{\"@id\":\"https://canopticon.com/about#chris\"}},{\"@type\":\"ScholarlyArticle\",\"headline\":\"Sensory syncrasis\",\"url\":\"https://canopticon.com/papers/syncrasis\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-10-04\",\"author\":{\"@id\":\"https://canopticon.com/about#chris\"}},{\"@type\":\"ScholarlyArticle\",\"headline\":\"Heterocrasis\",\"url\":\"https://canopticon.com/papers/heterocrasis\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-10-05\",\"author\":{\"@id\":\"https://canopticon.com/about#chris\"}},{\"@type\":\"ScholarlyArticle\",\"headline\":\"Typomora\",\"url\":\"https://canopticon.com/papers/typomora\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-10-04\",\"author\":{\"@id\":\"https://canopticon.com/about#chris\"}},{\"@type\":\"ScholarlyArticle\",\"headline\":\"Exocrasis\",\"url\":\"https://canopticon.com/papers/exocrasis\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-10-05\",\"author\":{\"@id\":\"https://canopticon.com/about#chris\"}},{\"@type\":\"ScholarlyArticle\",\"headline\":\"Pharmakrasis\",\"url\":\"https://canopticon.com/papers/pharmakrasis\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-10-05\",\"author\":{\"@id\":\"https://canopticon.com/about#chris\"}},{\"@type\":\"ScholarlyArticle\",\"headline\":\"Narcocrasis\",\"url\":\"https://canopticon.com/papers/narcocrasis\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-10-05\",\"author\":{\"@id\":\"https://canopticon.com/about#chris\"}},{\"@type\":\"ScholarlyArticle\",\"headline\":\"Why Temperature\",\"url\":\"https://canopticon.com/papers/why-temperature\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-11-22\",\"author\":{\"@id\":\"https://canopticon.com/about#chris\"}}]}</script>\n<script defer src=\"/site.js?v=fnsmi5\"></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<a href=\"#main\" class=\"skip\">Skip to content</a>\n<div class=\"hd\"><header class=\"hd-in\"><a href=\"/\" class=\"wm\">canopticon</a><nav aria-label=\"Primary\" class=\"nav\"><a href=\"/theories\">Theories</a><a href=\"/papers\" aria-current=\"page\">Papers</a><a href=\"/writing\">Writing</a><a href=\"/research\">Research</a><a href=\"/lexicon\">Lexicon</a></nav><a href=\"/search\" class=\"hd-search\">Search</a></header></div>\n<main id=\"main\" class=\"main\">\n<div class=\"col prose pp-page\">\n<div class=\"kicker\"><span class=\"pill\" style=\"background:#efe6f6;color:#5a2d82\">Paper</span></div>\n<h1 class=\"h-display\">Papers</h1>\n<p class=\"dek\">Long original work. Each paper states a claim, works it through the published research with numbered references, and names what it finds. The terms they coin are in the <a href=\"/lexicon\" class=\"ulink\">Lexicon</a>; the ideas stated formally are the <a href=\"/theories\" class=\"ulink\">Theories</a>.</p>\n<section class=\"pp-sec\" aria-labelledby=\"pp-series\">\n<div class=\"pp-sh\"><h2 id=\"pp-series\">McLuhan and the senses</h2><span class=\"pp-sm\">7 papers · 4–5 October 2026</span></div>\n<p class=\"pp-si\">Marshall McLuhan said every medium changes “the ratio among our senses.” The claim was filed as metaphor. These papers read it literally, test it against modern neuroscience from ADHD and typing to drugs and addiction, and end in a synthesis: one configuration of the senses that media, drugs and illness all re-temper. Read in order, or start anywhere.</p>\n<ol class=\"pp-list\"><li class=\"pp-row\"><span class=\"pp-n\">01</span><div class=\"pp-b\"><a href=\"/papers/krasis\" class=\"pp-t\">Krasis</a><p class=\"pp-d\">The synthesis of the series. McLuhan said every medium changes the ratio among our senses; six papers test that literally, from ADHD and typing to drugs and addiction, and find one configuration that media, drugs and illness all re-temper.</p><span class=\"pp-f\"><span>12 min</span><span>5 Oct</span></span></div><span class=\"pp-tag\"><span class=\"pill lg\" style=\"background:#efe6f6;color:#5a2d82\">Synthesis</span></span></li><li class=\"pp-row\"><span class=\"pp-n\">02</span><div class=\"pp-b\"><a href=\"/papers/syncrasis\" class=\"pp-t\">Sensory syncrasis</a><p class=\"pp-d\">McLuhan meant his &quot;sense ratios&quot; literally. The brain science he reached for failed; predictive processing now gives the idea a mechanism, a name and five questions to measure.</p><span class=\"pp-f\"><span>20 min</span><span>4 Oct</span></span><span class=\"pp-x\"><span class=\"pp-l\">Coins</span><a href=\"/concepts/sensory-syncrasis\" class=\"pp-term\">Sensory syncrasis</a></span></div><span class=\"pp-tag\"><span class=\"pill lg\" style=\"background:#efe6f6;color:#5a2d82\">The senses</span></span></li><li class=\"pp-row\"><span class=\"pp-n\">03</span><div class=\"pp-b\"><a href=\"/papers/heterocrasis\" class=\"pp-t\">Heterocrasis</a><p class=\"pp-d\">ADHD as a different starting balance of the senses. The strongest difference is in overall gain; the body and inner speech are mixed; binding is not looser.</p><span class=\"pp-f\"><span>16 min</span><span>5 Oct</span></span><span class=\"pp-x\"><span class=\"pp-l\">Coins</span><a href=\"/concepts/heterocrasis\" class=\"pp-term\">Heterocrasis</a></span></div><span class=\"pp-tag\"><span class=\"pill lg\" style=\"background:#e4ecf7;color:#1f4e8c\">ADHD</span></span></li><li class=\"pp-row\"><span class=\"pp-n\">04</span><div class=\"pp-b\"><a href=\"/papers/typomora\" class=\"pp-t\">Typomora</a><p class=\"pp-d\">McLuhan said electric media would bring back the voice. For fifty years computers made us type instead. The delay was the keyboard, not a mistake in the theory — and it is ending.</p><span class=\"pp-f\"><span>22 min</span><span>4 Oct</span></span><span class=\"pp-x\"><span class=\"pp-l\">Coins</span><a href=\"/concepts/typomora\" class=\"pp-term\">Typomora</a><a href=\"/concepts/epanaphony\" class=\"pp-term\">Epanaphony</a></span></div><span class=\"pp-tag\"><span class=\"pill lg\" style=\"background:#e3f0e6;color:#1f5e36\">Voice &amp; typing</span></span></li><li class=\"pp-row\"><span class=\"pp-n\">05</span><div class=\"pp-b\"><a href=\"/papers/exocrasis\" class=\"pp-t\">Exocrasis</a><p class=\"pp-d\">The computing environment, not the screen, is the medium: keyboard, memory, search and network move part of the configuration of the senses and of memory outside the body.</p><span class=\"pp-f\"><span>16 min</span><span>5 Oct</span></span><span class=\"pp-x\"><span class=\"pp-l\">Coins</span><a href=\"/concepts/exocrasis\" class=\"pp-term\">Exocrasis</a></span></div><span class=\"pp-tag\"><span class=\"pill lg\" style=\"background:#f3e9d4;color:#6b4e14\">Computing</span></span></li><li class=\"pp-row\"><span class=\"pp-n\">06</span><div class=\"pp-b\"><a href=\"/papers/pharmakrasis\" class=\"pp-t\">Pharmakrasis</a><p class=\"pp-d\">Each class of drug sets its own balance of the senses — and the evidence for that is better than for any medium. When a drug meets a medium, as music does in psychedelic therapy, the two make a third thing.</p><span class=\"pp-f\"><span>18 min</span><span>5 Oct</span></span><span class=\"pp-x\"><span class=\"pp-l\">Coins</span><a href=\"/concepts/pharmakrasis\" class=\"pp-term\">Pharmakrasis</a></span></div><span class=\"pp-tag\"><span class=\"pill lg\" style=\"background:#fbe9df;color:#8a3a1f\">Drugs</span></span></li><li class=\"pp-row\"><span class=\"pp-n\">07</span><div class=\"pp-b\"><a href=\"/papers/narcocrasis\" class=\"pp-t\">Narcocrasis</a><p class=\"pp-d\">In dependence, what goes unseen is not the drug but the shifted baseline: the allostatic state is the medium, the drug its content. Two routes back — one turns the gain down, one makes the ground visible.</p><span class=\"pp-f\"><span>28 min</span><span>5 Oct</span></span><span class=\"pp-x\"><span class=\"pp-l\">Coins</span><a href=\"/concepts/narcocrasis\" class=\"pp-term\">Narcocrasis</a><a href=\"/concepts/anacrasis\" class=\"pp-term\">Anacrasis</a></span></div><span class=\"pp-tag\"><span class=\"pill lg\" style=\"background:#fbe9df;color:#8a3a1f\">Addiction</span></span></li></ol>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pp-sec\" aria-labelledby=\"pp-more\"><div class=\"pp-sh\"><h2 id=\"pp-more\">Building on the series</h2><span class=\"pp-sm\">1 paper</span></div><ol class=\"pp-list\"><li class=\"pp-row\"><span class=\"pp-n\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><div class=\"pp-b\"><a href=\"/papers/why-temperature\" class=\"pp-t\">Why Temperature</a><p class=\"pp-d\">McLuhan never said why media are hot or cool. Read as regulation, hot and cool describe how much a medium supplies, how much it arouses, and whether the receiver predicts before the answer arrives. Working paper.</p><span class=\"pp-f\"><span>30 min</span><span>22 Nov</span></span><span class=\"pp-x\"><span class=\"pp-l\">Theory</span><a href=\"/theories/cognitive-ectothermy\" class=\"pp-term th\">Cognitive ectothermy</a></span></div><span class=\"pp-tag\"><span class=\"pill lg\" style=\"background:#efe6f6;color:#5a2d82\">Paper</span></span></li></ol></section>\n</div>\n</main>\n<footer class=\"ft\"><div class=\"ft-in\"><span class=\"ft-wm\">canopticon</span><span class=\"ft-line\">An independent research publication by Chris Telford. Every quote links back to its source. CC BY 4.0. <a href=\"/about\">About this site →</a></span><nav aria-label=\"Footer\" class=\"ft-nav\"><div class=\"ft-col\"><span class=\"ft-h\">The work</span><a href=\"/theories\">Theories</a><a href=\"/papers\">Papers</a><a href=\"/writing\">Writing</a><a href=\"/research\">Research</a><a href=\"/lexicon\">Lexicon</a><a href=\"/open\">Open questions</a></div><div class=\"ft-col\"><span class=\"ft-h\">Browse</span><a href=\"/library\">Everything</a><a href=\"/research?kind=Investigation\">Investigations</a><a href=\"/writing?kind=Essay\">Essays</a><a href=\"/writing?kind=Brief\">Briefs</a><a href=\"/search\">Search</a></div><div class=\"ft-col\"><span class=\"ft-h\">The site</span><a href=\"/about\">About</a><a href=\"/about#m-rules\">How it is checked</a><a href=\"/follow\">Follow</a><a href=\"/feed.xml\">RSS feed</a><a href=\"/llms.txt\">llms.txt</a></div></nav></div></footer>\n</body>\n</html>"
}
